  url: https://dataplusfeminism.mit.edu/
  what_it_curates: >-
    Data Feminism book and seven principles; Data + Feminism Lab; participatory research; Data Against
    Feminicide; Audit the Streets; feminist data methods; Data Feminism for AI.
  why_it_matters: >-
    Research and practice ecosystem examining data science as power and developing intersectional feminist
    approaches to data collection, classification, analysis, visualization, labor and community collaboration.
